#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:1
msgid "Handle model families"
msgstr "处理模型家族"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:3
msgid ""
"Use model-family checks to choose safe selectors, quantization schemes, and "
"validation scope for Dense, MoE, DeepSeek-class, and special checkpoint "
"layouts."
msgstr "使用模型家族检查，为 Dense、MoE、DeepSeek 类以及特殊 checkpoint 布局选择安全的选择器、量化方案和验证范围。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:7
msgid "Before selecting a family workflow:"
msgstr "选择家族工作流之前："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:9
msgid "run `flagos-compressor inspect --input \"$MODEL\"`"
msgstr "运行 `flagos-compressor inspect --input \"$MODEL\"`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:10
msgid "save JSON inspection output for large or unfamiliar checkpoints"
msgstr "为大型或不熟悉的 checkpoint 保存 JSON 检查输出"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:11
msgid ""
"identify whether the model is Dense, standard MoE, fused MoE, DeepSeek-"
"class, or contains auxiliary modules such as `self_attn.indexer`"
msgstr "识别模型是 Dense、标准 MoE、融合 MoE、DeepSeek 类，还是包含 `self_attn.indexer` 等辅助模块"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:12
msgid "run every command as a dry-run before writing weights"
msgstr "在写入权重之前将每条命令都作为空运行执行"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:14
msgid "Handle Dense models"
msgstr "处理 Dense 模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:16
msgid "Use Dense checks for standard attention plus gated MLP architectures."
msgstr "对标准注意力加门控 MLP 架构使用 Dense 检查。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:18
msgid "Start with the conservative W8A16 group baseline:"
msgstr "从保守的 W8A16 group 基线开始："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:32
msgid "Then test additional schemes only after the baseline is valid:"
msgstr "仅在基线有效后再测试其他方案："

