#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:41
msgid ""
"W8A16 channel is valid for ordinary Dense Linear and attention weights. It "
"is not valid for routed MoE weights. Dense models should not report routed "
"expert counts during inspection."
msgstr ""
"W8A16 channel 适用于普通 Dense Linear 和注意力权重。它不适用于路由 MoE 权重。Dense "
"模型在检查时不应报告路由专家数量。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:43
msgid "For D04, omit `--group-size`:"
msgstr "对于 D04，省略 `--group-size`："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:57
msgid "Handle MoE models"
msgstr "处理 MoE 模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:59
msgid "Use MoE selectors to keep expert structures intact."
msgstr "使用 MoE 选择器以保持专家结构完整。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:61
msgid "For routed expert compression:"
msgstr "对于路由专家压缩："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:75
msgid "For routed experts plus attention:"
msgstr "对于路由专家加注意力："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:91
msgid ""
"Do not use a manual regex to select only part of a fused expert bank. Gate, "
"up, and down projections in a fused expert module must be selected together."
" Do not select only part of a routed expert bank."
msgstr "不要使用手写正则只选择融合专家权重组的一部分。融合专家模块中的 gate、up 和 down 投影必须一起选择。不要只选择路由专家权重组的一部分。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:94
msgid "Handle Qwen3.5 MoE models"
msgstr "处理 Qwen3.5 MoE 模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:96
msgid ""
"The implementation recognizes the Qwen3.5 MoE model types `qwen3_5_moe` and "
"`qwen3_5_moe_text`, with model classes such as "
"`Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration` and `Qwen3_5MoeForCausalLM`."
msgstr ""
"该实现可识别 Qwen3.5 MoE 模型类型 `qwen3_5_moe` 和 `qwen3_5_moe_text`，以及 "
"`Qwen3_5MoeForConditionalGeneration` 和 `Qwen3_5MoeForCausalLM` 等模型类。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:98
msgid "A supported fused expert bank has logical shape:"
msgstr "受支持的融合专家权重组具有如下逻辑形状："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:104
msgid ""
"`gate_up_proj` is split along the output dimension. Fused W8A8 banks may be "
"expanded to loader-facing names such as `experts.<id>.<projection>.weight` "
"and `experts.<id>.<projection>.weight_scale`. Do not infer this layout from "
"the model name alone. Confirm layout recognition, shape inference, and "
"complete bank counts in `inspect` and dry-run output. Unknown or "
"inconsistent fused layouts must be rejected rather than guessed."
msgstr ""
"`gate_up_proj` 沿输出维度拆分。融合 W8A8 权重组可能会展开为面向加载器的名称，例如 "
"`experts.<id>.<projection>.weight` 和 "
"`experts.<id>.<projection>.weight_scale`。不要仅根据模型名称推断此布局。请在 `inspect` "
"和空运行输出中确认布局识别、形状推断和完整权重组数量。未知或不一致的融合布局必须被拒绝，而不是猜测。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:106
msgid "Handle DeepSeek-class models"
msgstr "处理 DeepSeek 类模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:108
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-class models may include MLA-style attention names and standard or "
"fused expert layouts. Recognized projection leaves can include:"
msgstr "DeepSeek 类模型可能包含 MLA 风格的注意力名称以及标准或融合专家布局。可识别的投影叶节点可能包括："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:110
msgid "`wq`, `wk`, `wv`, `wo`"
msgstr "`wq`, `wk`, `wv`, `wo`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:111
msgid "`q_a_proj`, `q_b_proj`"
msgstr "`q_a_proj`, `q_b_proj`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:112
msgid "`kv_a_proj_with_mqa`, `kv_b_proj`"
msgstr "`kv_a_proj_with_mqa`, `kv_b_proj`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:113
msgid "`wq_a`, `wq_b`, `wkv_a`, `wkv_b`"
msgstr "`wq_a`, `wq_b`, `wkv_a`, `wkv_b`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:114
msgid "`kv_proj`, `o_b_proj`"
msgstr "`kv_proj`, `o_b_proj`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:115
msgid ""
"`in_proj_qkv`, `in_proj_qkvz`, `in_proj_ba`, `in_proj_z`, `in_proj_b`, "
"`in_proj_a`"
msgstr ""
"`in_proj_qkv`, `in_proj_qkvz`, `in_proj_ba`, `in_proj_z`, `in_proj_b`, "
"`in_proj_a`"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:117
msgid ""
"These projection leaves are recognized by the classifier, but model-specific"
" support is determined by `inspect` and the dry-run plan. Treat those "
"outputs as authoritative for an unfamiliar DeepSeek variant."
msgstr "这些投影叶节点会被分类器识别，但模型专用支持由 `inspect` 和空运行计划决定。对于不熟悉的 DeepSeek 变体，请以这些输出为准。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:121
msgid "Use built-in selectors instead of selecting half of an MLA pair:"
msgstr "使用内置选择器，而不是只选择 MLA 对的一半："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:136
msgid ""
"Two-dimensional routed expert banks may use names such as "
"`experts.<id>.gate_proj`, `up_proj`, and `down_proj`, or `w1`, `w2`, and "
"`w3`. The complete gate/up/down set and every selected expert must remain "
"closed. Fused attention units and fused expert banks must be selected as "
"complete inference units."
msgstr ""
"二维路由专家权重组可能使用 `experts.<id>.gate_proj`、`up_proj` 和 `down_proj`，或 `w1`、`w2` 和"
" `w3` 等名称。完整的 gate/up/down 集合以及每个被选中的专家都必须保持闭合。融合注意力单元和融合专家权重组必须作为完整推理单元被选择。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:138
msgid ""
"Some DeepSeek variants include `self_attn.indexer`. A broad attention "
"selection can be narrowed with:"
msgstr "某些 DeepSeek 变体包含 `self_attn.indexer`。可以通过以下方式缩小宽泛的注意力选择范围："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:154
msgid ""
"Some DeepSeek-V4 compressor or indexer modules are classified specially and "
"do not become ordinary linear selections. Always use dry-run output to "
"verify the actual set."
msgstr ""
"某些 DeepSeek-V4 compressor 或 indexer 模块会被特殊分类，不会成为普通 linear "
"选择。始终使用空运行输出验证实际集合。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:156
msgid "Validate each family case"
msgstr "验证每个家族用例"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:158
msgid "After generation, validate each output:"
msgstr "生成后，验证每个输出："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:164
msgid ""
"Then load the output in the target runtime and run task-specific accuracy, "
"memory, and throughput checks."
msgstr "然后在目标运行时中加载输出，并运行特定任务的准确性、内存和吞吐量检查。"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:166
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "回退处理"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:168
msgid "If a model family cannot be recognized safely:"
msgstr "如果无法安全识别模型家族："

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:170
msgid "narrow the selection and rerun dry-run"
msgstr "缩小选择范围并重新运行空运行"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:171
msgid "prefer built-in selectors over regex for fused structures"
msgstr "对于融合结构，优先使用内置选择器而不是正则表达式"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:172
msgid "do not force one model's fused MoE layout onto another model"
msgstr "不要将一个模型的融合 MoE 布局强行套用到另一个模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/handle-model-families.md:173
msgid ""
"add and test explicit layout support before processing an unknown fused "
"expert ABI"
msgstr "在处理未知融合专家 ABI 之前，先添加并测试显式布局支持"

